{"3250140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Capybaria", "steam_appid": 3250140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4775520], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thought capybaras just chew grass, bask in the sun, and take baths with mandarins? Think again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Capybaria</strong> — the most unpredictable game about the world's greatest rodents. Here, a relaxing life simulator is closely intertwined with incredible, absurd adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your zen, become an exemplary family member... or plunge this world into total chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐹 LIFE AS A CAPYBARA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your unique capybara and explore the open world. Meet other inhabitants, make friends, find love, and build the strongest capybara family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/5fe496919bca6acddf402e9d9ef2ddaf.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/5fe496919bca6acddf402e9d9ef2ddaf.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/5fe496919bca6acddf402e9d9ef2ddaf.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💥 MIND-BLOWING QUESTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget boring &quot;fetch 10 apples&quot; tasks. How about answering a call on a retro brick phone? Driving a car? Or becoming a secret agent who must decide: let the President of Capybaria drop a nuclear bomb or go to jail for insubordination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/51b4fb919f2be50940cc99ef7cc5d34e.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/51b4fb919f2be50940cc99ef7cc5d34e.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/51b4fb919f2be50940cc99ef7cc5d34e.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚖️ KARMA AND FREEDOM OF CHOICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action has consequences. Help others to cleanse your karma and stay on the path of good. Or become the main villain of Capybaria. The choice is yours, and the world will react to your deeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/d4b48859a7c3857bba4c6591598b3909.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/d4b48859a7c3857bba4c6591598b3909.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/d4b48859a7c3857bba4c6591598b3909.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛠️ AWAKEN YOUR INNER CREATOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to live in the bushes! The game features an advanced building system. Construct everything: from cozy wooden huts to incredible architectural masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/b6e921972cfdf608776291309fe7bf46.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/b6e921972cfdf608776291309fe7bf46.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/b6e921972cfdf608776291309fe7bf46.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚀 SECRETS OF THE ANCIENT MONKEY AND SPACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore picturesque locations, find hidden secrets, and collect artifacts. Discover the wisdom of the Ancient Monkey... and when Earth becomes too small for you, embark on an exciting journey to distant, uncharted planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/2a6d6415561c14fd42b91d81e96a2b81.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/2a6d6415561c14fd42b91d81e96a2b81.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/2a6d6415561c14fd42b91d81e96a2b81.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of a cozy simulator and a crazy RPG with quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Karma system that affects gameplay and NPC attitudes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and intuitive building system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of humor, pop-culture references, and meme situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to just chill in a hot spring (a must-have!).</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thought capybaras just chew grass, bask in the sun, and take baths with mandarins? Think again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Capybaria</strong> — the most unpredictable game about the world's greatest rodents. Here, a relaxing life simulator is closely intertwined with incredible, absurd adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your zen, become an exemplary family member... or plunge this world into total chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐹 LIFE AS A CAPYBARA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your unique capybara and explore the open world. Meet other inhabitants, make friends, find love, and build the strongest capybara family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/5fe496919bca6acddf402e9d9ef2ddaf.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/5fe496919bca6acddf402e9d9ef2ddaf.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/5fe496919bca6acddf402e9d9ef2ddaf.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💥 MIND-BLOWING QUESTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget boring &quot;fetch 10 apples&quot; tasks. How about answering a call on a retro brick phone? Driving a car? Or becoming a secret agent who must decide: let the President of Capybaria drop a nuclear bomb or go to jail for insubordination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/51b4fb919f2be50940cc99ef7cc5d34e.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/51b4fb919f2be50940cc99ef7cc5d34e.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/51b4fb919f2be50940cc99ef7cc5d34e.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚖️ KARMA AND FREEDOM OF CHOICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action has consequences. Help others to cleanse your karma and stay on the path of good. Or become the main villain of Capybaria. The choice is yours, and the world will react to your deeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/d4b48859a7c3857bba4c6591598b3909.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/d4b48859a7c3857bba4c6591598b3909.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/d4b48859a7c3857bba4c6591598b3909.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛠️ AWAKEN YOUR INNER CREATOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to live in the bushes! The game features an advanced building system. Construct everything: from cozy wooden huts to incredible architectural masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/b6e921972cfdf608776291309fe7bf46.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/b6e921972cfdf608776291309fe7bf46.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/b6e921972cfdf608776291309fe7bf46.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚀 SECRETS OF THE ANCIENT MONKEY AND SPACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore picturesque locations, find hidden secrets, and collect artifacts. Discover the wisdom of the Ancient Monkey... and when Earth becomes too small for you, embark on an exciting journey to distant, uncharted planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/2a6d6415561c14fd42b91d81e96a2b81.poster.avif?t=1785502407\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/2a6d6415561c14fd42b91d81e96a2b81.webm?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/extras/2a6d6415561c14fd42b91d81e96a2b81.mp4?t=1785502407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of a cozy simulator and a crazy RPG with quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Karma system that affects gameplay and NPC attitudes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and intuitive building system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of humor, pop-culture references, and meme situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to just chill in a hot spring (a must-have!).</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The coziest yet craziest game about capybara! Chill in hot springs, build architectural masterpieces, and start a family... then get behind the wheel, fly to space, or decide whether to let the President detonate a nuclear bomb. Your karma decides the fate of this world!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/df1eabae332515bb1966375d047f8c2a71c4f6f3/header.jpg?t=1785502407", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/434568531d15d577fe4c3b61c891c4d724f5e2b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785502407", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250140/434568531d15d577fe4c3b61c891c4d724f5e2b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785502407", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 или AMD Ryzen 5 @ 3.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 TI or equivalent 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> An internet connection is required to support online avatar saving</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> W